Agent Jones barrelled in and, with the speed of an apex carnivore, grabbed Cracker by the throat. Momentum lifted Cracker of his feet and sent him\'97with Agent Jones\'92 gorilla-size hand stilling choking him\'97into the living room, over the coffee table and into the couch. The couch thudded against the wall.\
