\f1\i0 Sarah rummaged the kitchen for something she could improvise as weapon. The were no pots or pans, or rolling pins, or quality flatware, or pepper mills, or candlesticks, or wine carafes, or even gravy boats. The few items of  cutlery were disposable. 
